WEBVTT

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:04.850
The Autoscorers are withdrawing!

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:06.520
Get Hibiki-chan out of there!

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:07.700
I'll head out immediately.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:10.300
We can handle it!

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.040
So please move forward with Project Ignite!

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.520
The completion of the enhanced Symphogears!

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:10.980
Open your eyes,

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:11.960
Hibiki!

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.480
Please, Hibiki!

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:21.020
Hibiki...

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.670
It's okay.

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:24.240
Tachibana will be fine.

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:25.750
Of course!

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:29.750
That idiot won't get knocked out of the 
game over something like this.

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:32.000
That's right.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.880
And we can't just stand around and wait, either!

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.890
<i>It's been a week...</i>

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:50.520
<i>And Hibiki still hasn't woken up.</i>

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.910
<i>When she wakes up</i>

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:55.740
<i>and learns that the song
 in her heart has been broken,</i>

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:58.870
<i>what will she think?</i>

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:13.270
It's like your mind isn't here, is it?

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.170
Oh, I...

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.950
I'm sorry.

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:19.250
Kohinata-san,

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:22.180
please be sure to solve whatever 
is troubling you by exam day.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:23.440
Yes, sir.

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:24.730
Okay, next person.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.060
Project Ignite...

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:36.040
Presently, it's at eighty-nine percent of completion.

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:38.650
Thanks to the old Section 2's data

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.820
on the first and second relics,

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:45.320
and to Elfnein-chan's hard work, 
we're ahead of schedule.

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:48.350
Since it overlapped with generator maintenance,

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:50.450
I worried about what might happen.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.580
But luckily, we were able to get 
the energy needed to work

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:56.260
and keep the base functional, from outside.

00:03:57.110 --> 00:04:00.160
But modifying the Symphogears means

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:02.590
gaining access to the core of their secrets.

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:04.780
Things are just that bad.

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:07.350
And Yatsuhiro intervened on our behalf, too.

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:10.320
Who's Yatsuhiro?

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:13.630
One of the government VIPs, 
who maintains the security guarantee

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:17.300
by means that skirt the line 
between legal and illegal.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:21.990
Meddling in this, via extralegal interventions, 
is a simple matter for him.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:24.640
Basically, who is he?

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:28.120
Cabinet Intelligence Officer, Kazanari Yatsuhiro.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:32.120
The commander's brother 
and Tsubasa-san's father.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:34.880
Then you should have just said so!

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:36.900
No need to make it so complicated.

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:40.020
I believe he was also the one

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.210
who backed my entry into S.O.N.G.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:45.070
I understand... As I suspected, 
he is a relative of yours.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:47.510
What is it?

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:53.230
I just checked on Hibiki.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.410
She's still hooked up to life support,

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:59.110
but there are no large external 
wounds. She'll be fine.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.540
Thank you.

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:17.370
Papa?

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:20.130
It exploded...

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:38.690
Is it good?

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.930
It's sour, and it stinks, and it isn't good at all.

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.940
I'd give it a zero out of ten.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.200
Cooking's supposed to be like alchemy.

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:51.200
Follow the recipe, and it'll be fine...

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:54.120
Why can't I do it like Mama?

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:57.290
I'll make dinner tomorrow.

00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:59.960
That way, it's sure to be more delicious!

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.740
Is there a trick to it?

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:03.100
It's a secret.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:05.650
You can figure out the secret yourself.

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.470
You're an alchemist, right?

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.260
A difficult task, to be sure.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.390
Until you find the solution,

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:16.290
I'll keep making your meals.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:28.030
A dream...

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:31.850
Carol's memories from hundreds of years ago.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.540
I fell asleep for ten minutes or so?

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.790
But it should have made my head clearer.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:42.790
I need to hurry and modify the Gears!

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:45.850
Carol... Live,

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:47.760
and know more of the world.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.760
The world?

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.140
Carol, that is your...

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.300
<i>What was Papa trying to tell her?</i>

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:58.990
<i>I wanted to know the answer,</i>

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:01.910
<i>so I decided to protect the world from Carol.</i>

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.770
<i>But why did Carol</i>

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.890
<i>give me her memories,</i>

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:11.890
<i>and not just alchemical knowledge?</i>

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:18.340
It's time. Let's finish this.

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:22.580
Alca-Noise signal detected!

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.410
Specifying coordinates.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.920
No... The enemy's after...

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:34.800
The base generator that's supplying our power!

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.810
What's going on?

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:40.100
The Alca-Noise are attacking the dock's generator.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.530
Not just ours!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:44.800
There are similar attacks happening 
throughout the city.

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:47.730
Electrical power supply rates 
are dropping everywhere!

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:50.980
If the power's cut off now,

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:53.490
it'll affect our attempt to modify the Gears!

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.660
Internal power won't last that long.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.790
Then the medical room...

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.620
Wh-What is it, Shirabe?

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:06.790
Shh...

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:14.810
What are you going to do with

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:16.930
your beautiful spy glasses?

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.060
Buy time.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.010
What?

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:22.020
Right now, the important thing 
is getting the time

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.710
and energy we need to complete 
the enhanced Symphogears.

00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:29.070
That's true, but we can't do 
anything without a plan!

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:34.320
I do have a plan, Kiri-chan.

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:38.450
The medical room?

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:43.030
We're going to buy time for the Gear 
modification in a place like this?

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:46.310
At this rate, we won't be able to maintain 
the medical room's power, either.

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:56.800
Then just say there's someone you want to save!

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:57.720
No.

00:08:58.080 --> 00:08:59.430
Why not?

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:01.630
It's embarrassing.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.920
I don't want to let anyone

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:06.600
but you to see me say or do 
something embarrassing.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.980
Shirabe!

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:19.410
Jeez, what was that?

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:22.240
I found it.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:31.510
The new Noise's phase-shift barriers aren't 
as strong as those of the old ones.

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:33.960
Concentrate your fire, and avoid 
their dissection organs!

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:41.130
We can do this!

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:46.600
Here we go!

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:47.340
Yeah.

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:57.280
<i>Fallian Shul Shagana tron.</i>

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:33.110
<i>A twin-tailed rondo.</i>

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:33.730
<b>Type Alpha 100 Samsara</b>

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:36.150
<i>Your punishment's about to begin,</i>

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:42.200
<i>initializing the justice that will rip you apart.</i>

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:42.570
<b>K1LL JUL1ET</b>

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:48.290
<i>Antagonism crashing into an unripe heart,</i>

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:51.530
<i>voltage with nowhere to go,</i>

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:53.840
<i>and hidden tears.</i>

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:53.280
Not bad.

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:57.680
<i>The words of a hypocrite,</i>

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:57.050
Shul Shagana and Igalima have entered combat!

00:10:57.530 --> 00:11:00.380
Do you know what you're doing?

00:10:57.680 --> 00:11:00.380
<i>torn apart.</i>

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:01.820
Of course!

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:05.440
While we hold them off, finish the 
enhanced Symphogears.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.030
<i>I want to be strong.</i>

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:12.900
<i>If I rely on others to protect me,</i>

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:18.610
<i>I'll never fulfill the dream in my heart.</i>

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:21.570
<i>If I become strong,</i>

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:23.570
As long as it doesn't hit...

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:28.430
<i>will I be able to get closer to the shining sun?</i>

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.370
<b>Type Delta Bewitching Axel</b>

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:33.120
<i>You shine down on me.</i>

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:36.020
<i>Just loving!</i>

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:40.440
Even working together, they can barely keep up.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:42.640
These guys are doomed.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:46.850
<b>What Caused the Disaster?        Surviving Families Rage</b>

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:49.350
<b>Murderer                                      Thief</b>

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:49.350
<b>

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:01.610
<i>I worked really hard at my therapy 
so I could live with everyone again.</i>

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.260
<i>So why...</i>

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:05.540
<i>Daddy!</i>

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:20.260
All I do is crush the things I care about.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:24.190
But Miku cheered me up.

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:26.340
She said I saved her.

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.150
I need to live up to her feelings.

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:44.990
The vitals for the Shul Shagana- and 
Igalima-wielders are stable?

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:48.170
The backfire from the Gears is being minimized.

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:49.990
What's going on?

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:53.320
Then that's what that alarm was?

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:53.870
Yeah.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.250
They stole LiNKER from the medical room!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:01.260
You can't mean the Model K... 
The LiNKER that Kanade left us!

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:06.140
You're the type who can't do anything 
the peaceful way, huh, Shirabe?

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.900
It would make sense if the medical room

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:12.590
had drugs to treat Symphogear backfire.

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:16.150
This is where we recovered after training.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.030
Until the Gears are modified...

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.650
...we'll protect the generator!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.630
Target destroyed. Flashy.

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.700
Like a castle of wooden blocks...

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:48.720
We don't even need help from 
Leiur-chan's little sister.

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:21.770
Energy supply to the target area is dropping.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.640
It will shortly reach the target number.

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.980
I'll leave the ley line release to you.

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:30.300
I will begin the final preparations.

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.810
Then it is finally beginning?

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:34.850
It's finally ending.

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:36.680
And all things

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:40.560
will be written in the Apocalypse.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.190
Gotcha!

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:52.830
Shirabe! Kirika!

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:54.910
We can't just stay here and watch!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:57.620
Wait!

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.460
What can we do right now?

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:02.130
You just want us to shut up and watch?

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.140
Tsubasa-san, Chris-san...

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:15.510
I have a request for both of you.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:20.270
Ow...

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:22.690
She won't let us go easily.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:27.950
Hey there, kiddies.

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:30.200
I'm pretty tough.

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:32.200
She's insulting us by calling us "kids."

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:34.740
Let's teach her a lesson!

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:37.120
They're using more LiNKER?

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:38.810
Bring them back here!

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:39.870
Any more—

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:40.620
Let them go.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.710
This is their atonement

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.880
for being cowards that day.

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:48.380
Their atonement for being cowards?

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.500
We lost our way and ran, because we lacked

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:54.820
the courage to believe in someone.

00:15:55.440 --> 00:16:00.060
So we shall atone by fighting, 
and believing that Elfnein

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:02.520
will revive the Symphogears!

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:14.990
If we are together...

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:16.370
...we won't be afraid!

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:28.750
An overdose...

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.190
Who cares about a nosebleed?

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:37.010
Let's go, Kiri-chan. Together.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:38.680
Cut her in two!

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.020
<b>Taken Rapunzel</b>

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:52.240
Are you going to make this fun for me?

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:02.790
<i>Danger signals flashing.</i>

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.790
<i>Hell or Heaven, which do ya want? Death!</i>

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:09.920
<i>Attention! If you want to get chopped in half...</i>

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:12.010
<i>Watch out! Death!</i>

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:17.970
<i>Antagonism crashing into an unripe heart,</i>

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.760
<b>Type Gamma Svastika Firewheel</b>

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:21.260
<i>voltage with nowhere to go,</i>

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:24.100
<i>and hidden tears.</i>

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.100
<b>Emergency Type Sigma Forbidden Moon Wheel"</b>

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:27.440
<i>The words of a hypocrite,</i>

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:30.110
<i>These rails just go forward, right? Death!</i>

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.860
<i>torn apart.</i>

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.610
<i>Let's kiss and dream of a world</i>

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:37.040
<i>that we'll never cut apart!</i>

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:40.120
Compatibility values are rising, 
and increasing output!

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:43.790
Their unison is even stronger 
than the numbers indicate.

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:46.790
But their light won't last long!

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:49.080
But even so, Shirabe and Kirika

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:52.610
will tear apart the thorns before 
them, and open a path!

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:55.300
<i>you'll never fulfill your true desires.</i>

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:58.790
<i>Holding the courage to be strong in your heart,</i>

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:58.800
<i>If I become strong,</i>

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:01.990
<i>as a light envelops the Moon.</i>

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:01.990
<i>will I be able to get closer to the shining sun?</i>

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:04.840
<i>I want to shine down on you</i>

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:05.270
With work, even a child can put out 
a decent amount of phonic gain.

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:07.430
<i>You shine down on me.</i>

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:07.440
<i>with one half of a pair of true loves.</i>

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:09.110
One of these two, with their high 
outputs, might be enough!

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:10.610
<i>Just loving!</i>

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:10.630
<i>Just loving!</i>

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:14.710
<i>I want to be strong.</i>

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:17.930
<i>If I rely on others to protect me,</i>

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:23.710
<i>I'll never fulfill the dream in my heart.</i>

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.530
<b>Type Beta  Massive Circle Slash</b>

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:27.190
<i>Holding the courage to be strong in your heart,</i>

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:27.190
<i>If I become strong,</i>

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.090
<i>will I be able to get closer to the shining sun?</i>

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.090
<i>as a light envelops the Moon.</i>

00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:33.710
<i>I want to shine down on you</i>

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.980
<i>with one half of a pair of true loves.</i>

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:35.980
Boom.

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:47.900
Switching to internal power.

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:51.410
Don't give in.

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.840
Please, Serena...

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:55.320
Give them a miracle!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:57.920
Hibiki-kun!

00:18:58.550 --> 00:18:59.610
Hibiki!

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:03.210
Thank you.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:04.800
Thanks to you—

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:05.910
No, thank you.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:09.160
It's thanks to you that I was able to sing again.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.270
But are you okay?

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:15.500
I'm fine! Just fine!

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:20.930
Tell me what's going on.

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:28.670
At this rate, nothing will change.

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:29.560
We can't change it.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:31.670
But we're trying so hard...

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:32.910
Why?

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:35.820
This isn't fair! I want to change!

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.320
Not bad.

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:40.320
But it's time to stop playing around!

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:49.520
Bye-bye!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:19:59.880
Kiri-chan!

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:07.850
Pay attention, or I'll hit you from behind.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.600
Don't stand in my way!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.260
I'll crush your Gear, too,

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:15.690
so you can be just like her!

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:20.820
Micha, her compatibility value 
is too low to be of interest.

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:22.700
Do what you want with her.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.410
Gotcha!

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:25.420
Go!

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:36.090
See?

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:39.090
R-Run... Shirabe!

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:41.760
I can't run and leave you here.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:45.390
You saved my life.

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:48.600
I'll use everything I have to save you!

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:52.100
Time for the dissection!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.950
Out of the way!

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:12.880
Someone... Save her.

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:15.480
My friend...

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.840
My beloved Shirabe!

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:34.600
Someone, save Shirabe!

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:39.500
Someone!

00:21:58.300 --> 00:22:02.300
"Someone"? That isn't very nice.

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:05.630
A sword...

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:07.260
Yes.

00:22:08.280 --> 00:22:10.560
A sword that, when drawn, rouses the wind.
